      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i dont need a textbook definition or a lecture on why everyone's entitled to their opinion. i'm working on a campaign strategy and we need to dismantle the democratic socialist platform. be real with me—what are the actual logical holes and structural flaws in their economic model that we can use to tear their arguments apart in debates?",
